#. module: ssi_dashboard_item_chart
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_dashboard_item_chart.field_dashboard_item__chart_cumulative
msgid ""
"Add one extra dataset with the running cumulative total of this chart's "
"first dataset, always drawn as a line regardless of 'Chart Type'. Only used "
"when 'Type' is 'Chart' and not available when 'Chart Type' is 'Pie', "
"'Doughnut' or 'Polar Area'."
