#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_dashboard_item_chart.field_dashboard_item__chart_data_label
msgid ""
"Show each data point's value directly on the chart. 'Percentage' shows each "
"point's share of its own dataset's total instead of its raw value. Only used"
" when 'Type' is 'Chart'."
msgstr ""

#. module: ssi_dashboard_item_chart
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:ssi_dashboard_item_chart.field_dashboard_item__chart_show_legend
